WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.858
Zippy zoomed around the spaceport.

2
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:15.241
Trucks jumped out of the way.

3
00:00:15.242 --> 00:00:19.615
Zippy laughed.

4
00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:22.583
Then he gasped.

5
00:00:22.584 --> 00:00:26.329
Zippy was speeding toward a truck.

6
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.470
The truck was carrying a satellite.

7
00:00:29.471 --> 00:00:34.586
Zippy slammed his brakes and slid.

8
00:00:34.587 --> 00:00:37.543
Bam!

9
00:00:37.544 --> 00:00:51.717
Zippy crashed into the truck.

10
00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.620
"My wheel is broken!" the truck said.

11
00:00:55.621 --> 00:01:03.725
"I can't bring Rocky this satellite."

12
00:01:03.726 --> 00:01:09.444
"Jeb and I can help!" Eddy said.

13
00:01:09.445 --> 00:01:16.406
Eddy and Jeb hurried over.

14
00:01:16.407 --> 00:01:20.127
Jeb picked up the satellite.

15
00:01:20.128 --> 00:01:26.887
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

16
00:01:26.888 --> 00:01:36.413
Eddy drove it to Rocky.

17
00:01:36.414 --> 00:01:39.189
Ms. Fender went to Zippy.

18
00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:43.635
"You're in big trouble," she said.

19
00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.481
"Get ready!" a voice said.

20
00:01:46.482 --> 00:01:49.414
"Blastoff is in ten seconds!"

21
00:01:49.415 --> 00:02:02.071
Everyone counted down.

22
00:02:02.072 --> 00:02:05.586
"Good-bye!" Rocky said.

23
00:02:05.587 --> 00:02:08.259
Rumble! Rumble!

24
00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:16.232
Rocky blasted off.

25
00:02:16.233 --> 00:02:24.518
Eddy waved. "Bye, Rocky!"

